Subject: dxso: Preserve the texm3x3vspec eye vector magnitude.

Based on f229921c1b7f14edeadeccff04a9e65d0a016148, after 0003.
R = 2 * dot(N, E) / dot(N, N) * N - E. Only N may be normalized;
normalizing E changes volume coordinates even though cube directions agree.
Keep the shared texm3x3spec path unchanged in this bounded fix.

diff --git a/src/dxso/dxso_compiler.cpp b/src/dxso/dxso_compiler.cpp
--- a/src/dxso/dxso_compiler.cpp
+++ b/src/dxso/dxso_compiler.cpp
@@ -2811,7 +2811,8 @@
         else
           eyeRay = emitRegisterLoad(ctx.src[1], vec3Mask).id;
 
-        eyeRay = m_module.opNormalize(vec3Type, eyeRay);
+        if (opcode != DxsoOpcode::TexM3x3VSpec)
+          eyeRay = m_module.opNormalize(vec3Type, eyeRay);
         normal = m_module.opNormalize(vec3Type, normal);
         uint32_t reflection = m_module.opReflect(vec3Type, eyeRay, normal);
         reflection = m_module.opFNegate(vec3Type, reflection);
